clearFeedRoute.t.sol
├── when caller is not the module's safe
│  └── it should revert with UnauthorizedCaller
└── when caller is the module's safe
   ├── given no feed route is registered for the provided token
   │  └── it should revert with PriceFeedRouteNotRegistered
   └── given a feed route is registered for the provided token
      ├── it should clear the feed route of the provided token in contract storage
      ├── it should keep the staleness thresholds of the route's feeds
      └── it should emit a FeedRouteCleared event
